<title>USA: Worldtex says buying Texfi business.</title>
<headline>Worldtex says buying Texfi business.</headline>
<dateline>HICKORY, N.C. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Worldtex Inc said Thursday it has singed a letter of intent to purchase the narrow elastic fabric business of Texfi Industries Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed by the companies.</p>
<p>The company said projected sales for the business, located in Asheboro, N.C., are $21 million in 1997.</p>
